  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Boonie Hat with Mosquito Netting is the ultimate outdoor accessory, offering protection from the sun's harmful rays and pesky insects. Made from lightweight and breathable cotton/polyester blends, this bucket hat keeps you cool and comfortable during outdoor activities like hunting, fishing, and camping.&nbsp;The addition of mosquito netting provides an extra layer of defense against bugs, ensuring uninterrupted outdoor adventures.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "5358",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Boonie Hat with Mosquito Netting is the ultimate outdoor accessory, offering protection from the sun's harmful rays and pesky insects. Made from lightweight and breathable cotton/polyester blends, this bucket hat keeps you cool and comfortable during outdoor activities like hunting, fishing, and camping. The addition of mosquito netting provides an extra layer of defense against bugs, ensuring uninterrupted outdoor adventures. The fishing hat features 4 screened side vents for enhanced ventilation, keeping you cool in warm conditions and hot weather. An adjustable chin strap ensures a secure fit, even in windy conditions. Whether you're exploring the wilderness or working in the yard, Rothco&rsquo;s Boonie Hat with Mosquito Netting is a must-have for any outdoor enthusiast. Keep your head in the game with Rothco&rsquo;s collection of headwear and accessories. Designed with precision and purpose, our headgear is built to withstand the harshest conditions. Whether you&rsquo;re tackling the cold in one of our Watch Caps or Balaclavas, or out on a mission in a Boonie Hat or Fatigue Cap, our diverse range of headwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from active-duty personnel to outdoor enthusiasts.</p>",
